        "Description": "Welcome to the Phantom training of Steel Cove. Your mission is to eliminate Roberts by a headshot with gun, Holden with a headshot by gun too, Carter by snapping his neck while choking, Norfolk by drowning him in a toilet (FYI, theres emetic poison at the bottom of the yacht that u can put in his drink as yacht staff) and finally Gibson by an explosive thats at the start of the mission. You will need to escape by helicopter and dont kill anyone else than the targets, take as long as you need to.",
